I'll just be honest, though.

92
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,660
I already like all of you girls plenty as it is.

93
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:57,020
So to say you have to make me fall for you isn't the most accurate.

94
00:05:57,880 --> 00:06:01,340
Use any method you want, but make sure my heart skips a beat.

95
00:06:01,820 --> 00:06:04,640
Just enough that I can't wait to give you a big kiss.

96
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:05,280
Cool?

97
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:09,300
Right, make his heart skips a beat. Got it.

98
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:12,080
And make it good, so that he'll want a kiss.

99
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:14,480
So be it.

100
