125
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:31,740
The spirits will go one at a time, each trying to make Shido's hearts give a beat in their own erotic way.

126
00:07:31,740 --> 00:07:37,120
While that happens, we will, of course, be closely monitoring Shido's excitement level here in the control room.

127
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:40,700
