130
00:07:51,020 --> 00:07:53,580
As you know, the deadline is 12 o'clock tonight.

131
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:55,260
Is all of that clear?

132
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:56,520
Cut it down!

133
00:07:56,940 --> 00:07:59,400
