179
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:55,100
Just do it!

180
00:09:55,180 --> 00:09:56,760
Strap a rope around his neck like rain!

181
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,640
It's the only way!

182
00:09:57,700 --> 00:09:58,240
You hear me?

183
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,980
