238
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:49,440
What?

239
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:50,620
Awkward.

240
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:52,320
Now that you mention it.

241
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:53,460
Oops.

242
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:55,560
Uh-oh.

243
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,660
It's so cold.

244
00:12:00,660 --> 00:12:01,100
Uh.

245
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:05,840
Yes.

246
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:07,960
Today's very first fanfare.

247
00:12:08,820 --> 00:12:09,780
Yeah, my sisters.

248
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,900
You made that boy fall for you hard.

249
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:13,240
He's not kidding.

250
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:15,060
You two really got me good.

251
00:12:15,060 --> 00:12:18,820
So, next is Natsumi, right?

252
00:12:19,340 --> 00:12:21,420
You volunteered to go next all on your own?

253
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:22,560
Thank you for that.

254
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:23,740
Are you kidding?

255
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,520
The rest of us drew straws.

256
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,540
This condition of yours is absurd.

257
00:12:28,180 --> 00:12:30,120
The others might be able to manage this,

258
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,700
but to make you fall for me?

259
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,580
It's not even possible.

260
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,420
That's definitely not true.

261
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,560
You're plenty cute, Natsumi.

262
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:39,900
I can't do this now.

263
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,280
Hold on a sec.

264
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,280
Hmm?

265
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:53,540
Hey, let's play some multiplayer, huh?

266
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,080
Okay, sure.

267
00:12:55,820 --> 00:12:58,720
Wait, but Natsumi doesn't even own the game, does she?

268
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:01,780
Nah, then she can just play by herself.

269
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,260
How dare they?

270
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:05,940
You chose that game on purpose, you jerks!

271
00:13:10,580 --> 00:13:11,100
Huh.

272
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:13,220
Now I've got him in the bag for sure.

273
00:13:13,220 --> 00:13:16,980
Natsumi, it's dangerous to use spirit power right now.

274
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,000
